This project incorporates information derived from the following publicly
available sources. These sources retain their own copyrights and terms of use.
The data collected here was used for academic research under educational fair use.

- PGA Tour official statistics: https://www.pgatour.com/stats/putting
- Eden Steak analysis: https://edensteak.com/?p=33
- Golf Monthly WITB coverage: https://www.golfmonthly.com
- EssentiallySports player profiles: https://www.essentiallysports.com
- Sky Sports Golf leaderboard: https://www.skysports.com/golf
- MyGolfSpy equipment reviews: https://mygolfspy.com
- Wikipedia (2026 Masters Tournament): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Masters_Tournament
